---
title: "outflow_limit - Borrow Outflow Rate Limiting (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_config: get outflow_limit_24h for asset type
    q_get_config --> q_get_current: get current_window_usage from outflow tracker
    q_get_current --> q_calc_released: calc released amounts from expired windows
    q_calc_released --> q_update_tracker: available = outflow_limit_24h - current_usage + released
    q_update_tracker --> q_check: check borrow_amount <= available
    q_check --> q_error: borrow_amount > available
    q_error --> [*]: abort error (outflow limit exceeded)
    q_check --> q_record: borrow_amount <= available
    q_record --> q_update_window: record borrow_amount in current time window
    q_update_window --> [*]: outflow check passed

    note right of q_calc_released
        INV-001: outflow_limit is per-asset 24-hour rolling window
        INV-002: borrowed amounts are released after 24 hours
        INV-003: new amounts released every 30 minutes
        INV-004: right_pointer = current time, left_pointer = current - 24h
    end note

    note right of q_check
        INV-005: borrow_amount + current_usage - released <= outflow_limit_24h
        INV-006: outflow limit applies to both borrows and withdrawals
    end note
